        },
        {
          "description": "投げる人は決まりました。拾う人はまだです。",
          "displayName": "テニスボール",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "負責丟的人選好了，撿球的人還沒。",
          "displayName": "網球",
          "locale": "zh_Hant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "familyShareable": false,
      "internalID": "7893B6B6-1A46-5762-B27B-E0F74B7BD2E6",
      "type": "NonConsumable",
      "productID": "character_duck",
      "referenceName": "오리",
      "displayPrice": "1100",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "description": "오리발 내미는 데는 자신 있어요. 진짜 오리발이거든요.",
          "displayName": "오리",
          "locale": "ko_KR"
        },
        {
          "description": "An expert at ducking blame—with duck feet.",
          "displayName": "Duck",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        {
          "description": "知らんぷりなら得意です。本物のアヒルですから。",
          "displayName": "アヒル",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "很會裝傻，畢竟牠真的有一雙鴨掌。",
          "displayName": "鴨子",
          "locale": "zh_Hant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "familyShareable": false,
      "internalID": "63AAABB0-EF26-5A4C-94DE-A38E91F720B2",
      "type": "NonConsumable",
      "productID": "character_poop",
      "referenceName": "똥",
      "displayPrice": "1100",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "description": "누가 불렀는지는 모르겠지만, 일단 나왔어요.",
          "displayName": "똥이",
          "locale": "ko_KR"
        },
        {
          "description": "Not sure who called, but here it is.",
          "displayName": "Poop",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        {
          "description": "誰に呼ばれたかは不明ですが、とりあえず出ました。",
          "displayName": "うんち",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "不知道是誰叫牠，總之先出來了。",
          "displayName": "便便",
          "locale": "zh_Hant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "familyShareable": false,
      "internalID": "596ED1FE-D143-5614-92F1-EE58F1C920FC",
      "type": "NonConsumable",
      "productID": "throwable_tissue_ball",
      "referenceName": "휴지 뭉치",
      "displayPrice": "1100",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "description": "똥휴지인지 아닌지는 모르겠어요. 일단 피하세요!",
          "displayName": "휴지 뭉치",
          "locale": "ko_KR"
        },
        {
          "description": "Used or not? No one knows. Just dodge it!",
          "displayName": "Tissue Ball",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        {
          "description": "使用済みかは不明です。とにかく避けて！",
          "displayName": "ティッシュのかたまり",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "不知道是不是用過的，總之快閃！",
          "displayName": "衛生紙團",
          "locale": "zh_Hant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "familyShareable": false,
      "internalID": "040F216E-EAD2-55B6-841B-27ACFC89E060",
      "type": "NonConsumable",
      "productID": "character_tteokbokki",
      "referenceName": "떡볶이",
      "displayPrice": "1100",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "description": "순한맛이라더니요. 누구 기준인지는 안 알려줬어요.",
          "displayName": "떡볶이",
          "locale": "ko_KR"
        },
        {
          "description": "They said mild. They never said for whom.",
          "displayName": "Tteokbokki",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        {
          "description": "甘口だそうです。誰にとってかは教えてくれません。",
          "displayName": "トッポッキ",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "說是微辣，卻沒說是以誰的標準。",
          "displayName": "辣炒年糕",
          "locale": "zh_Hant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "familyShareable": false,
      "internalID": "7EF2BD9A-9F8A-5531-9717-512E0ABF225A",
      "type": "NonConsumable",
      "productID": "throwable_fish_cake_skewer",
      "referenceName": "어묵꼬치",
      "displayPrice": "1100",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "description": "드시라고 드린 건데 왜 휘두르세요?",
          "displayName": "어묵꼬치",
          "locale": "ko_KR"
        },
        {
          "description": "It was for eating. Why are you swinging it?",
          "displayName": "Fish Cake Skewer",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        {
          "description": "食べてほしくて渡したのに、なぜ振り回すの？",
          "displayName": "オムク串（練り天）",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "是給你吃的，為什麼揮來揮去？",
          "displayName": "魚板串",
          "locale": "zh_Hant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "familyShareable": false,
      "internalID": "51A425A5-9D10-59A8-8AD7-90552D610DA5",
      "type": "NonConsumable",
      "productID": "character_quokka",
      "referenceName": "쿼카",
      "displayPrice": "1100",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "description": "항상 웃고 있어요. 방금 잎사귀를 던진 것도 얘예요.",
          "displayName": "쿼카",
          "locale": "ko_KR"
        },
        {
          "description": "Still smiling after throwing that leaf.",
          "displayName": "Quokka",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        {
          "description": "いつも笑顔。さっき葉っぱを投げたのもこの子です。",
          "displayName": "クオッカ",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "總是在笑，剛才丟葉子的也是牠。",
          "displayName": "短尾矮袋鼠",
          "locale": "zh_Hant"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "familyShareable": false,
      "internalID": "A1937E87-3CC2-59E7-A10F-B32C8D8526DB",
      "type": "NonConsumable",
      "productID": "throwable_leaf",
      "referenceName": "잎사귀",
      "displayPrice": "1100",
      "localizations": [
        {
          "description": "쿼카의 도시락이에요. 던져도 되는지는 안 물어봤어요.",
          "displayName": "잎사귀",
          "locale": "ko_KR"
        },
        {
          "description": "Quokka's lunch. Thrown without asking.",
          "displayName": "Leaf",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        {
          "description": "クオッカのお弁当。投げていいかは聞いていません。",
          "displayName": "葉っぱ",
          "locale": "ja"
        },
        {
          "description": "短尾矮袋鼠的便當。沒問過能不能丟。",
